        "reference": "3 Nephi 10:3",
        "book": "3 Nephi",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "O ye people of these great cities which have fallen, who are descendants of Jacob, yea, who are of the house of Israel, how oft have I gathered you as a hen gathereth her chickens under her wings, and have nourished you.",
